<title>USA: NUR Advanced signs for financing pact.</title>
<headline>NUR Advanced signs for financing pact.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>NUR Advanced Technologies Ltd said Wednesday that it has signed a letter of intent with AT&amp;T Capital for AT&amp;T to provide financing services for NUR customers, starting in Europe.</p>
<p>Under the agreement AT&amp;T Capital would arrange financing for NUR customers who want to buy the digital color printing systems that NUR makes, sells and services. AT&amp;T Capital is controlled by AT&amp;T Corp.</p>
</text>
